# devkit-api

Public FastAPI local developer kit (auth, notes, tasks, AI summarize with mock fallback).

## Commands

- Run: `uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000`
- Test: `pytest -q`
- Env: copy `.env.example` → `.env`

## Conventions

- Routers thin; logic in `services/` + `store/`
- New resource = schema + store + router + test + wire in `main.py`
- JWT on notes/tasks/AI; never commit secrets
- Do not import private JobAgent code

Claude Code mirrors: `CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/rules/`, `.claude/skills/`
